# Keep the build context free of dependencies, secrets, and VCS metadata.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store

.git
.github
.husky
.idea
.vscode
.expo
.turbo
**/.turbo

dist
**/dist
build
**/build
coverage
**/*.lcov
logs
**/*.log
tmp
temp

# Never send environment files (including examples) into an image build.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

EduTech
*.md
!docs/docker/CONTAINER_ARCHITECTURE.md
